    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_wrong_finger_count">화면에 닿은 손가락: <xliff:g id="wanted">%2$d</xliff:g>개가 아니라 <xliff:g id="fingers">%1$d</xliff:g>개.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_fingers_landed_apart">손가락이 <xliff:g id="ms">%1$d</xliff:g> ms 간격으로 닿았으며, 최대 <xliff:g id="limit">%2$d</xliff:g> ms까지 허용됩니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_finger_lifted_early">모든 손가락이 닿기 전에 한 손가락이 떨어졌습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_fingers_lifted_apart">손가락이 <xliff:g id="ms">%1$d</xliff:g> ms 간격으로 떨어졌으며, 최대 <xliff:g id="limit">%2$d</xliff:g> ms까지 허용됩니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_became_exploration">손가락이 너무 오래 멈춰 있었거나 처음에 너무 느리게 움직여 터치하여 탐색이 되었습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_slow_start">첫 1cm에 <xliff:g id="ms">%1$d</xliff:g> ms가 걸렸으며, 최대 <xliff:g id="limit">%2$d</xliff:g> ms까지 허용됩니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_paused">손가락이 <xliff:g id="ms">%1$d</xliff:g> ms 동안 느려졌으며, 1cm마다 최대 <xliff:g id="limit">%2$d</xliff:g> ms까지 걸릴 수 있습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_too_short">움직임이 <xliff:g id="mm">%1$.0f</xliff:g>mm에 불과했으며, <xliff:g id="limit">%2$.0f</xliff:g>mm 이상이어야 합니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_wrong_direction_one_finger">손가락이 <xliff:g id="direction">%1$s</xliff:g> 움직이기 시작했습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_wrong_direction">손가락들이 <xliff:g id="direction">%1$s</xliff:g> 움직이기 시작했습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_off_line">경로가 직선에서 <xliff:g id="degrees">%1$.0f</xliff:g>도 벗어났으며, 최대 <xliff:g id="limit">%2$.0f</xliff:g>도까지 허용됩니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_curved">경로가 <xliff:g id="wanted">%2$d</xliff:g>개가 아니라 <xliff:g id="parts">%1$d</xliff:g>개 부분으로 꺾였습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_turn_missing">방향 전환이 감지되지 않았습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_second_part_wrong">방향을 바꾼 후 손가락이 <xliff:g id="direction">%1$s</xliff:g> 움직였습니다.</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_finding_tap_moved">탭하는 동안 손가락이 <xliff:g id="mm">%1$.1f</xliff:g>mm 밀렸으며, 최대 <xliff:g id="limit">%2$.1f</xliff:g>mm까지 허용됩니다.</string>
